  includes these files.

Notes on the data:
  The contradiction matrix is a SPARSE subset of Altshuller's classical
  39x39 engineering-parameter table. The vendored copy contains 109 cells
  and covers improving parameters 1 through 19 only. An absent cell does
  not mean "no solution"; by the empty-box convention any of the 40
  inventive principles may apply. The classical matrix has been frozen
  since 1985 and maps engineering, not software, parameters. It is used
  here as an OPTIONAL grounding lookup, secondary to the 40 inventive
  principles and the Ideality heuristic.
